# Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6 - Epic Skill Feats
# Table 5-12 and pages 97-99

Epic Reputation	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESTAT:1,CHA=21	BONUS:SKILL|Diplomacy,Intimidate|6	DESC:+6 bonus on Diplomacy, Intimidate, and Perform checks. At 26+ ranks, +3 per 5 additional ranks.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.97
Epic Skill Focus	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	DESC:+12 bonus on all skill checks with chosen skill. At 31+ ranks, +6 per 10 additional ranks.	MULT:YES	STACK:NO	CHOOSE:SKILL|PC	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.97
Skill Mastery (Epic)	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Epic Skill Focus	DESC:Roll twice and take the higher result with chosen skill.	MULT:YES	STACK:NO	CHOOSE:SKILL|PC	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.99
Skill Perfection	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Skill Mastery (Epic)	DESC:Once per day, automatically treat result as natural 20 with chosen skill.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.99
Epic Trapfinding	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESKILL:1,Perception=22	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Trapfinding	DESC:Automatic Perception check when passing within 5 feet of a trap.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.97
Expert Aid	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESTAT:1,INT=21	DESC:When using Aid Another, provide bonus equal to 1/2 your ranks in the skill.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.97
Legendary Athlete	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESTAT:2,STR=21,DEX=21	BONUS:SKILL|Acrobatics,Climb,Swim|6	DESC:+6 bonus on Acrobatics, Climb, and Swim. At 26+ ranks, +3 per 5 additional ranks.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.97
Legendary Climber	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESTAT:1,DEX=21	PRESKILL:1,Climb=21	DESC:Climb at half base speed. +8 racial bonus on Climb. Can always take 10.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.98
Legendary Craftsman	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	DESC:+6 bonus on three Craft skills. At 26+ ranks, +3 per 5 additional ranks.	MULT:YES	STACK:NO	CHOOSE:SKILL|Craft	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.98
Legendary Leaper	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESKILL:1,Acrobatics=21	DESC:Always have running start when jumping. Double Acrobatics for jumps with full run. Ignore first 20 feet of falls.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.98
Weightless Step	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESTAT:1,DEX=21	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Legendary Leaper	DESC:Soften falls regardless of height. DC 15 Acrobatics to ignore first 20 ft, +5 per 10 more feet.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.99
Meteor Landing	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESTAT:1,DEX=23	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Weightless Step	DESC:When falling 10+ ft, ranged touch attack to land on target dealing fall damage to them.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.99
Legendary Merchant	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESTAT:2,INT=21,WIS=21	BONUS:SKILL|Appraise,Sense Motive|6	DESC:+6 bonus on Appraise, Sense Motive, and chosen Profession. At 26+ ranks, +3 per 5 ranks.	MULT:YES	STACK:NO	CHOOSE:SKILL|Profession	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.98
Legendary Rider	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESKILL:1,Ride=21	DESC:No -5 penalty for bareback riding. Never need Ride checks for fast mount/dismount or control.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.98
Legendary Scholar	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESTAT:1,INT=21	DESC:+6 bonus on three Knowledge skills. At 26+ ranks, +3 per 5 additional ranks.	MULT:YES	STACK:NO	CHOOSE:SKILL|Knowledge	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.98
Legendary Tracker	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESTAT:1,WIS=25	PRESKILL:2,Knowledge (Nature)=25,Survival=25	DESC:Follow tracks across water, underwater, and through the air.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.98
Master Mage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESTAT:1,INT=21	BONUS:SKILL|Fly,Spellcraft,Use Magic Device|6	DESC:+6 bonus on Fly, Spellcraft, and Use Magic Device. At 26+ ranks, +3 per 5 additional ranks.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.98
