Outdoor Master	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESTAT:1,WIS=21	BONUS:SKILL|Handle Animal,Heal,Survival|6	DESC:+6 bonus on Handle Animal, Heal, and Survival. At 26+ ranks, +3 per 5 additional ranks.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.99
Second Skin	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Medium Armor Proficiency	DESC:No armor check penalties on skills with proficient armor. Sleep in armor without fatigue.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.99
Self-Concealment	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Skill	PRESTAT:1,DEX=30	PRESKILL:2,Acrobatics=27,Stealth=27	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Improved Evasion	DESC:10%% miss chance against all attacks. Stacks up to 50%% (5 times).	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.99
